ipment in question.\n- **Data centres:** Grid connection requests are expected to grow 9% in 2027. That is still growth, but slower than in 2026, because power availability limits new sites.\n- **Concentration risk:** Pellham is 35% of utility orders and Norvane is 21%, so these two utilities account for most of the utility demand.\n- **Financing caveat:** Utility bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 to 165bp. Norvane still priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably, but equity markets have been less receptive. Whether the utilities can fund these plans is a separate question that n3 is looking at.\n\nI did not check order backlogs or actual orders, so this rests on planned spending and connection requests, not confirmed orders.\n\nSources: utility-capex-2027, datacentre-demand, vltx-order-mix, utility-credit.","ttft_ms":2605,"type":"result","duration_ms":11784,"uuid":"12f0a346-bda8-465e-9328-d91a4b8843b8","ttft_stream_ms":1480,"time_to_request_ms":164,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":11,"system_prompt":13,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":16,"input_attachments":31,"input_hooks":7,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":13,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":13,"init_frame_send":6,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":8,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":6,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":4,"message_normalization":7,"client_creation":5,"request_build":10},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":34,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":75,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":192,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":118,"process_rss_mib_result":196,"process_anon_mib_result":115,"process_peak_rss_mib":201,"process_cpu_ms_turn":452,"process_wall_ms_turn":11783,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":43,"process_wall_ms_streaming":1190,"main_stream_count":2,"main_stream_event_count":114,"main_stream_chunk_count":9,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":43,"wall_ms":1190,"